                <pb facs="0633" n="531" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg531"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/173: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Administrator General of the Finances of
                        Persia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Millspaugh</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1924-07-26T03:27:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1924-07-24T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>].<lb/>[Received July 26, 1924—3:27
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>American Financial Mission have asked settlement in view of violation of
                    contracts.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Millspaugh</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
